.Dd November 10, 2026
.Dt UMU-RUN 1
.Os Rach2
.Sh NAME
.Nm umu-run
.Nd run a Windows program through Proton in the Steam Linux Runtime
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar program
.Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The x86-64 GNU root installs umu-launcher 1.4.4, the zipapp of its release,
as
.Pa /opt/umu/umu-run ,
linked from
.Pa /usr/bin/umu-run .
It is a Python program.
.Nm
runs
.Ar program
with the Proton that
.Ev PROTONPATH
names, inside the container of the Steam Linux Runtime that Proton's
.Pa toolmanifest.vdf
requires: sniper, Steam Linux Runtime 3.0, for the root's GE-Proton.
pressure-vessel, the runtime's container tool, builds the container with
bubblewrap in new user, mount and other namespaces, and passes in the
display, the GPU's device nodes, the PulseAudio socket and the D-Bus buses.
.Pp
umu keeps the runtime in
.Pa $XDG_DATA_HOME/umu/steamrt3 ,
or
.Pa $HOME/.local/share/umu/steamrt3 .
A missing runtime would be downloaded from Valve's servers, and an installed
one updated on each start.
.Xr rach2-game 1
with
.Fl -umu
unpacks the root's copy of the pinned runtime,
.Pa /opt/umu/SteamLinuxRuntime_sniper.tar.xz ,
there instead, and sets
.Ev UMU_RUNTIME_UPDATE
to 0; use it to start games.
umu checks an unpacked runtime against its mtree with pressure-vessel's
.Nm pv-verify
before it first runs it.
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width UMU_RUNTIME_UPDATE
.It Ev PROTONPATH
The Proton directory,
.Pa /opt/proton
on Rach2.
.It Ev GAMEID
.Li umu- Ns Ar id ;
umu sets
.Ev SteamGameId
and
.Ev SteamAppId
to
.Ar id .
.It Ev WINEPREFIX
The compatibility directory; umu links its
.Pa pfx
to the directory itself unless
.Pa pfx
is a directory.
.It Ev UMU_RUNTIME_UPDATE
0 turns the runtime's update off.
.It Ev UMU_LOG
1 or
.Li debug
logs umu's steps.
.It Ev STEAM_LINUX_RUNTIME_LOG
1 writes pressure-vessel's log to
.Pa var
in the runtime's directory.
.El
.Pp
umu sets
.Ev STEAM_COMPAT_DATA_PATH
to
.Ev WINEPREFIX
and passes Proton's other variables, such as
.Ev PROTON_USE_WOW64 ,
through the container unchanged.
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /opt/umu/SteamLinuxRuntime_sniper.tar.xz
.It Pa /opt/umu/umu-run
The launcher.
.It Pa /opt/umu/SteamLinuxRuntime_sniper.tar.xz
The pinned runtime, unpacked by
.Xr rach2-game 1 .
.It Pa /opt/umu/VERSIONS.txt
The versions of the runtime and pressure-vessel in that archive.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr bwrap 1 ,
.Xr proton 1 ,
.Xr rach2-game 1
